@startuml
title Webhook Remote-Change Notification Architecture

skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor<<Internal>> AliceBlue

box "Linux host"<<Internal>>
  participant "OneDrive Client\nWebhook module" as Client
  participant "Reverse proxy\n(e.g. nginx)" as Proxy
end box
participant "Firewall / Router" as Firewall
participant "Microsoft Graph API" as Graph

== Listener and subscription ==
Client -> Client: Listen on configured webhook_listening_host / port
Client -> Graph: Create subscription with webhook_public_url
Graph -> Firewall: Validation request containing validationToken
Firewall -> Proxy: Forward HTTPS request
Proxy -> Client: Proxy validation request
Client --> Proxy: Echo validationToken
Proxy --> Graph: HTTPS validation response
Graph --> Client: Subscription creation response\n(id + expiration)

== Change notification ==
Graph -> Firewall: HTTPS change notification
Firewall -> Proxy: Forward HTTPS request
Proxy -> Client: Proxy notification
Client -> Client: Validate / record notification signal
Client --> Proxy: HTTP acknowledgement
Proxy --> Graph: HTTPS acknowledgement
Client -> Client: Wake monitor loop / trigger online reconciliation

== Subscription lifecycle ==
loop Before expiry / after recoverable failure
  Client -> Graph: Renew existing subscription
  alt Subscription no longer exists
    Graph --> Client: Not found
    Client -> Graph: Recreate subscription
    Graph --> Client: New subscription metadata
  else Renewal succeeds
    Graph --> Client: Updated expiration
  end
end

opt Client shutdown
  Client -> Graph: Delete active subscription
end
@enduml
